1
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:09,440
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,853 --> 00:00:12,650
=Episode 5=

3
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:15,666
(You won't leave
this cold palace alive.)

4
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,320
(Mugwort, just as expected.)

5
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:25,200
Physician Li, what's wrong?

6
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:29,040
The mugwort smoke smells off.

7
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:30,760
Right.

8
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:33,560
It seems to be laced
with a sleeping draught.

9
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,440
My lord.

10
00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:35,800
Is there a fire in the cold palace?

11
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:36,840
Why is there so much smoke?

12
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,000
Go.

13
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:40,200
Go.

14
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:41,640
Okay.

15
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:01,520
Fu Rong!

16
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:02,880
What are you doing?

17
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:06,280
Someone's with a man in the back court.

18
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:07,640
Want to come see

19
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,200
who's been disgracing the harem?

20
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,360
Disgracing the harem?

21
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:15,080
What's going on?

22
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:17,800
Not sleeping at midnight?

23
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,360
Are you trying to defy me?

24
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:22,920
Or do you want a taste of my whip?

25
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:25,160
Get back inside! Now!

26
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:26,400
Auntie Sun.

27
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:29,160
There's a man in the cold palace.

28
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,520
We want to see

29
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:33,880
who's meeting her lover in secret.

30
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:35,600
A man?

31
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,880
That's nonsense!

32
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,560
What man? Where?

33
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,480
Why are you stopping us?

34
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:47,000
Unless you're in on it too?

35
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:48,400
Shaming the harem?

36
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:51,600
You wretch, I'll hit you!

37
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:57,720
Rebelling, are we?

38
00:02:57,880 --> 00:02:58,800
You wretch!

39
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,720
Get her!

40
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:05,360
I'll beat you to death today!

41
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:09,680
Stop it!

42
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,200
Stop it!

43
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:13,760
Are you all right?

44
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:14,320
What's going on?

45
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:15,000
I'm fine.

46
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:18,640
Don't move.

47
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:19,680
Well...

48
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:22,120
What's all this about?

49
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:25,680
What brings you all here tonight?

50
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:28,000
What's with the knockout smoke here?

51
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,200
Knockout smoke?

52
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,200
What knockout smoke?

53
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:33,840
The mugwort smoke in the air

54
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,000
has been laced with a sleeping draught.

55
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:36,160
As an imperial physician,

56
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:37,760
I do have the ability to detect poison.

57
00:03:37,760 --> 00:03:38,840
Confess now!

58
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:41,880
I don't know.

59
00:03:42,040 --> 00:03:43,160
I really don't know.

60
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:47,840
This smoke hides the man
who entered the palace

61
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:50,960
and is with someone
in the back court right now.

62
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:52,800
Go check if you don't believe me.

63
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,520
Search the back court!

64
00:03:54,640 --> 00:03:55,280
Yes.

65
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,160
What's going on?

66
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:15,800
Why is it Zhaoyi Shen?

67
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:29,880
Sir, a hidden passage
behind the cabinet!

68
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:31,320
Follow it, go!

69
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:32,320
Yes!

70
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:35,600
A hidden passage?

71
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:02,920
I never thought

72
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:05,640
that the one shaming the cold palace

73
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:08,000
would be you, Zhaoyi Shen.

74
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,600
By His Majesty's

75
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,080
decree:

76
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:17,880
Discarded consort Shen, for her crimes,

77
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:20,680
used mugwort smoke to drug everyone,

78
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:21,840
shaming the harem.

79
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:24,560
By palace law,
she shall end her own life

80
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,840
as a warning to all.

81
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:28,520
Her entire family is to be executed.

82
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:36,520
This servant accepts...

83
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:38,440
Your Majesty.

84
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,640
Take her away.

85
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:48,080
Move.

86
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,920
Oh, Zhaoyi Shen.

87
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:12,560
You really threw away a winning hand.

88
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:15,760
The Emperor once adored you.

89
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:18,120
What were you thinking,

90
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:21,040
meeting a man in secret?

91
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:25,640
His Majesty is already generous enough
to let you keep your body intact.

92
00:06:25,880 --> 00:06:28,000
Now, hurry up and jump in the well.

93
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:30,640
I still have to report back.

94
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:33,760
Eunuch Liu.

95
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:38,760
Please allow me
to speak with Zhaoyi Shen.

96
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:40,800
Fine.

97
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:42,080
Let's go.

98
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,320
I told you,

99
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:51,160
you wouldn't leave this palace alive.

100
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:53,120
Pah!

101
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,480
Tell me!

102
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:58,400
Why hurt a child

103
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,240
so cruelly?

104
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:02,400
You stole Jinxuan's title!

105
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:04,600
Who do you think you are?

106
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,840
How dare you compete with me?

107
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:11,840
Fu Rong, you wretch!

108
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:15,040
I'll haunt you even in death!

109
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:18,320
The cold palace will be your grave too!

110
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:22,440
Listen closely.

111
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:26,240
You think I went to all that trouble

112
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:28,240
to make you destroy the Pagoda

113
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:29,760
and get myself sent here,

114
00:07:29,840 --> 00:07:31,640
just so we could die together?

115
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:34,720
How naive.

116
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,560
I'd already noticed her.

117
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:39,760
She smelled of mugwort, too.

118
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:42,080
Running around the palace at night...

119
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,440
What a disgrace.

120
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,840
I apologize for disturbing you,
Your Highness.

121
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,280
Please forgive me.

122
00:07:48,200 --> 00:07:50,440
(She smells of mugwort.)

123
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:53,400
My death is nothing,

124
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:56,800
but you'll all die before I do.

125
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:59,160
I knew someone was behind you

126
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,760
when you killed Lingxi.

127
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:03,360
I came to the cold palace
to find evidence

128
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:05,080
against the one behind you.

129
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:08,680
So you knew all along.

130
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:11,080
This was all your scheme!

131
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:11,680
Right.

132
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:14,120
I set fire to the mugwort

133
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,600
and spread the smoke out.

134
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:18,000
And I had Physician Li
bring the guards.

135
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:20,360
Noble Consort Hui
may hold immense power,

136
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,120
and she can silence everyone here.

137
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:25,000
But can she silence the
whole Imperial Hospital?

138
00:08:25,640 --> 00:08:27,040
Your life comes first.

139
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:28,600
Don't throw it away.

140
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:30,600
Thanks.

141
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:40,080
If you really care about me,

142
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:42,160
then do me one favor.

143
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:49,240
Too bad she still managed to escape.

144
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:52,000
But I expected her to use you

145
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:54,720
as her scapegoat.

146
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:02,120
Where are we?

147
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:09,080
Qingzi, why are you...

148
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:11,800
Zhaoyi Shen, time to repay
Noble Consort Hui.

149
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:14,520
She means you'll take the blame
for shaming the harem.

150
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:15,560
Got that?

151
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:16,520
Qingzi!

152
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:19,280
But Noble Consort Hui
is so powerful now.

153
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:21,120
She's the Dowager's own niece.

154
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:23,720
Why fear a discarded consort?

155
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:26,040
Even if someone finds evidence,

156
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:28,480
she could just kill everyone here.

157
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:29,160
You fool!

158
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:30,920
The guards are already inside.

159
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:33,320
The physicians are here
to witness it all.

160
00:09:33,520 --> 00:09:34,960
The Noble Consort says,

161
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,440
if you repay her kindness today,

162
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:38,120
Princess Jinxuan will stay noble.

163
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:39,480
But if you refuse,

164
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:41,600
you and your daughter will both die.

165
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:51,440
You scheming wretch!

166
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,800
With brains like yours,

167
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,480
you could've climbed the ranks

168
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:56,520
or fight for favor.

169
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,960
You schemed against me instead!

170
00:10:59,040 --> 00:11:00,600
Where were you before?

171
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:03,840
How ridiculous!

172
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:08,480
Being someone else's lapdog,

173
00:11:08,760 --> 00:11:10,360
and you're proud of it?

174
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:11,880
You cling to power,

175
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:12,800
fight for favor,

176
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,400
yet in the end,

177
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:16,720
you were tossed aside like trash.

178
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,560
Dying in a well

179
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:22,040
is what you brought on yourself.

180
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:24,280
You keep calling people lapdogs.

181
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:25,960
But in this harem,

182
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:27,640
aren't we all imperial dogs?

183
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:29,520
You think you're above all this?

184
00:11:29,680 --> 00:11:32,040
You're part of this game, too!

185
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:34,760
Come on, fight!

186
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,840
Go fight the Noble Consort!

187
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:38,880
Let me tell you,

188
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:41,640
she's the one who killed your child.

189
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:45,080
I'll be waiting for you
in the afterlife.

190
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,000
Don't walk too fast

191
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:52,480
on the road to the underworld.

192
00:11:53,280 --> 00:11:54,520
It won't be long

193
00:11:55,160 --> 00:11:57,880
before I send Noble Consort Hui there

194
00:11:58,800 --> 00:12:02,840
to join you.

195
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:14,680
(Noble Consort Hui.)

196
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:18,360
(So you really are the one
who killed Lingxi.)

197
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:21,080
(From this day on,)

198
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:24,240
(I will give everything I have,)

199
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,600
(even if I'm shattered,)

200
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:28,680
(or condemned for eternity,)

201
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:31,880
(to tear you limb from limb,)

202
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:33,160
(and make you pay in blood.)

203
00:12:34,040 --> 00:12:37,000
(You'll pay for every sin
you've committed)

204
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:39,840
(with your own blood.)

205
00:13:31,100 --> 00:13:33,320
(Zhongning Palace)

206
00:13:38,653 --> 00:13:40,773
(Consort Qi)

207
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,400
Your Highness, your pulse is calm,

208
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:47,640
just slightly rapid.

209
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:49,240
It may be due to the dry weather

210
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:50,520
and your recent anxiety.

211
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:52,280
I'll prepare some medicine for you.

212
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:53,880
Take it every day

213
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:54,760
to calm your mind.

214
00:13:54,760 --> 00:13:56,000
Your health soon will be restored.

215
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:59,680
My headaches are a longstanding problem.

216
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:01,760
Thank you, Physician Li.

217
00:14:01,760 --> 00:14:03,800
Tending you is my duty.

218
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:07,240
Your Highness.

219
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:09,040
The flower house sent chrysanthemums.

220
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:10,840
(Yinshuang, Senior Palace Maid)
They say it's a new variety this year.

221
00:14:11,040 --> 00:14:12,160
Pure white in color,

222
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:13,400
it's called Jade Phoenix.

223
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:14,400
They're in full bloom.

224
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:16,640
Where would you like them displayed?

225
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:19,400
Tomorrow is the late Empress's
birthday and memorial day.

226
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:22,720
His Majesty and I honor her together
every year.

227
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:24,320
She loved chrysanthemums.

228
00:14:24,680 --> 00:14:25,720
How fitting.

229
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:29,320
Your Highness, I'll take my leave.

230
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:34,800
(Zhongning Palace)

231
00:14:46,560 --> 00:14:48,520
(Zhongning Palace)
These are famous in my hometown.

232
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:51,000
I've never seen blooms

233
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:52,400
this magnificent before.

234
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:54,320
Chrysanthemums stand for noble purity.

235
00:14:54,520 --> 00:14:56,600
I didn't know
you appreciated chrysanthemums too.

236
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:00,760
I know a little, that's all.

237
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:09,240
I won't disturb you, Your Highness.

238
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:25,080
Auntie Sun.

239
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:26,920
Do you know your crime?

240
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:28,560
Your Highness!

241
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:30,760
Spare me, Your Highness!

242
00:15:31,040 --> 00:15:32,840
I don't know who set the fire!

243
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:35,000
It drew the guards!

244
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:38,880
Useless!

245
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:41,240
I didn't summon you
to hear your excuses.

246
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:42,440
The secret passage was sealed.

247
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:44,240
I nearly got trapped inside!

248
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:46,000
Why do I even keep you fools around?

249
00:15:46,640 --> 00:15:47,280
Your Highness!

250
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:48,800
Spare me!

251
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:51,120
I'll make up for it!

252
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:54,160
Spare me, Your Highness!

253
00:15:56,800 --> 00:15:57,600
Fu Rong.

254
00:15:58,440 --> 00:15:59,560
It must be you!

255
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:02,440
No matter how much you know,

256
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:05,040
I can't let you live.

257
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:08,480
I'll show you what I'm capable of.

258
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:11,120
Take some people to the cold palace.

259
00:16:13,706 --> 00:16:17,900
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

260
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:22,880
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

261
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:27,810
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

262
00:16:28,050 --> 00:16:32,720
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

263
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:37,280
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

264
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:42,300
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

265
00:16:42,893 --> 00:16:47,180
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

266
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:52,000
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

267
00:16:52,426 --> 00:16:56,810
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

268
00:16:57,120 --> 00:17:00,300
♪Let the stars and sea♪

269
00:17:00,300 --> 00:17:01,960
(Changsheng Gate)

270
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:05,680
♪Wait for your return♪
